@baseUrl = http://localhost:5280
@token = 

### Listar zonas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/zones

### Listar espacios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/spaces

### Espacios libres
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/spaces?status=free

### Login operador
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ana",
  "pin": "1234"
}

### Cámara simulada (reproducir en loop en el cliente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cameras/demo

### Identidad por DNI
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/12345678
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reservar espacio
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/spaces/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/reserve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "12345678"
}
